  (text "NFC VOUT is isolated from SYS / BAT / +3V3; no assumed screen or MCU power harvesting.\nFull screen + fingerprint NFC authentication requires a charged battery and device ON.\nDo not route copper/ground/battery/shield under RF window on any PCB layer.\nFM11 has internal resonant capacitance; measure L, Q and resonance in assembled case.\nSchematic does not guarantee ISO14443 / CTAP-over-NFC interoperability."
